+## Functional interfaces and policy behavior
+
+[Contract](N14_OFFLINE_ENGINEERING_CONTRACT.md) defines the new additive facade. A trusted local launcher creates a researcher/demo_admin capability with fixed immutable source scope and explicit experimental permission. Requests cannot select paths, models, SQL, role or source roots. Context ownership prevents borrowing a different caller's verified context. Fixed files are read with N01/N07 fd-anchored safety primitives, exact hashes, hardlink/symlink/size/instance checks; sources/index are reverified before receipt rename and recovery.
+
+Requests use `astra.n14.search.v1`, bounded 1–1200-character query, top_k 1–5, fixed corpus hash and one of rich_lexical / semantic_minilm / lexical_weighted_rrf / append_only_semantic_rescue. Source exclusions reduce the trusted scope before ranking; an empty scope abstains. The lexical implementation is the existing 3-point topic/1-point content, minimum3, stable window-ID ties and unit dedup. Frozen hybrid policies always merge full top5 lists before returning requested k. Append-only preserves the lexical prefix; RRF preserves lexical top5 membership while permitting reordering. No parameter tuning occurred.
+
+With no admitted encoder, experimental requests explicitly report requested/effective policy, **MODEL_UNAVAILABLE** fallback and NOT_LOADED runtime. Corrupt/invalid provider data, timeout, cancellation or provider exception cannot silently become lexical success. Dependency injection tests use known saved vectors and mocks only. The unchanged native loader can be used only in a separately admitted runtime campaign; no caller path or implicit native import is added here. Cancellation discards late completion but does not prove forcible interruption of arbitrary native I/O.
+
+Results contain actual quotes, source metadata, canonical citations, method/rank/score meaning, corpus/index/model versions, pending review and **question_support:UNKNOWN / factual_answer:null**. Cosine and fusion scores are not confidence percentages. The unchanged N14-02 checker accepts complete exact attribution only, rejects altered/wrong binding and abstains from unverified paraphrase/location-only scope. The actual numerical Hz control has VALID attribution but N15 factual **ABSTAIN**. Valid citations do not authenticate relevance, entailment, numbers, population applicability or scientific review.
+
+Actual offline CLI examples, not renewed execution permission after delivery:
+
+```bash
+node scripts/n14-offline.mjs verify
+node scripts/n14-offline.mjs query --query='How does light influence the circadian clock?' --policy=rich_lexical --top_k=5
